~ convo_3
Fenn: Hey Wizard Guy, what do you do for fun?
Winston: Hmph. Why do thee careth?
Fenn: I dunno.
Winston: Well, I readeth, I suppose.
Fenn: Read what?
Winston: I do not knoweth. Like, mysteries and detective stories
Fenn: That's super cool! I like comic books. Do you read comics? I love the Garbage Man series, it's my favorite. Have you heard of Garbage Man?
Winston: Uhhhhh...
Az: Fenn! Stop bothering the wizard. He's busy being a freak, or whatever.
Winston: HEY!
=> END

~ convo_4
Winston: Grrrr, I'm really hungry...
Fenn: Oh no!! Do you have any food with you?
Winston: No. Maybe the workshop has stuff.
pause
Winston: Well, I foundeth some walnuts. Ho, pint-size. Couldst thee ask Az if I may hast some?
Fenn: Hey Az! Can Wizard man hath some of the walnuts in your workshop?
Az: What??? I guess?? But if you make a mess in my workshop, I will crush you.
Winston: Score! Walnuts be mine!
=> END

~ convo_5
Fenn: Hey Mr. Wizard. Who's your favorite Knight?
Winston: None of them! They're terrible! They don't do anything for the Kingdom!!!
Fenn: Okay... but if you have to pick?
Winston: Well... probably like... the Knight of Fury. She seemeth cool.
Fenn: Rose? I wouldn't have guessed that... I thought maybe Henric or something.
Winston: Well it doth not matter anyway! They're all stupid and lame!
Fenn: Okay then!
=> END

